## Program at a glance
At the current pace of 6 lane-miles a week, we reach about 110 lane-miles by 2026-11-30. That leaves about 10 for spring 2027.

## Districts
table = District,Planned,Done,Status; North,28,22,Green; Central,24,21,Green; East,26,15,Amber; South,22,11,Amber; West,20,5,Red

West is red. A water main replacement blocks 8 lane-miles until 2026-11-02, and the contractor's second paving crew is committed elsewhere until 2026-11-09.

## Decision needed
The council must choose one option:
- Pay $180,000 for an extra crew in the West district, or
- Carry the leftover miles into spring.

## Next two weeks
- 2026-10-23: the Central district finishes.
- 2026-10-26: public notices for the West district closures go out.
- 2026-10-27: paving of the Maple Avenue bridge approach in the East district.
